  "prompt": "In how many different stores did Voltmarkt sell something in each month? Use the sales table and its order_month column, the first day of the month the order was placed in. Return two columns, in this order: order_month and n_stores, the number of different store_code values with at least one order line in that month. Return one row per order_month, sorted by order_month from earliest to latest. The webshop, WEB-01, counts as a store, and every order line counts, including lines with missing units or a missing net_revenue_eur.",
